{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11447","headline":"将赴成都草堂途中有作先寄严郑公五首 二 · 杜甫","name":"将赴成都草堂途中有作先寄严郑公五首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"处处青江带白苹，故园犹得见残春。\n雪山斥候无兵马，锦里逢迎有主人。\n休怪儿童延俗客，不教鹅鸭恼比邻。\n习池未觉风流尽，况复旌州赏更新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_11447.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11447","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}